# .dockerignore - what never goes near the image build.
# The Dockerfile copies package*.json, tsconfig.json and src/ only. Everything below is
# either a credential, one family's data, or a build artefact: uploading it to the daemon
# would send a password across for no reason.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.git
.gitignore
.maestro
.maestro.md
node_modules
dist
*.log
.tmp*
data
family-planner/data
family-planner/profiles/family-*.json
family-planner/test/golden/home
